*> RUN FROM JCL JOB SHPNIGHT STEP060
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. SHP0003.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 INPUT-AREA.
    COPY SHP0003C.
01 WS-OUT-REC.
    *> SHIPMENT BLOCKED Y/N
    05 NO-SHIP-IND        PIC X VALUE 'N'.
    *> DELIVERY SURCHARGE
    05 SURCHG-AMT         PIC 9(4)V99 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAINLINE.
    ACCEPT INPUT-AREA
    PERFORM 4000-HAZMAT
    DISPLAY "NO-SHIP-IND=" NO-SHIP-IND
    DISPLAY "SURCHG-AMT=" SURCHG-AMT
    STOP RUN.
4000-HAZMAT.
    IF DANGER-GOODS-IND = 'Y'
        EVALUATE TRUE
            WHEN SERVICE-CD = 'O'
                MOVE 'Y' TO NO-SHIP-IND
            *> LONG-DISTANCE HAZARDOUS SURCHARGE
            WHEN ROUTE-KM > 800
                MOVE 75.00 TO SURCHG-AMT
            WHEN OTHER
                MOVE 25.00 TO SURCHG-AMT
        END-EVALUATE
    END-IF.
